Package: easymail
Version: 0.1.0
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libsoup-3.0-0, libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-0, libsqlite3-0
Maintainer: Frau Blücher <frau-blucher@btl.io>
Description: People-centric email client
 EasyMail is a people-centric email client for GNOME/Wayland,
 inspired by UniBox. It organizes your email by people, not folders,
 using the Exchange ActiveSync protocol for synchronisation.
 Built with Go, Wails, and Vue 3.
